{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bobo's Big Tower",
    "steam_appid": 3729890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/2746dd65bc06444cc21f819327697563.avif?t=1754415086\" width=506 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bobo's Big Tower</i> is an adorable roguelike strategy game</strong> in a style inspired by the GameBoy Color (8bit, 16x16, 3 colors per sprite + transparency!). Choose from a colorful cast of characters and solve procedurally-generated floors of puzzles to survive the onslaught of Bobo's minions blocking your path! <strong>Time only moves when you do</strong>, so be sure to strategize critically before each move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every character has their own starter items</strong> and weapon pools to work with throughout each run. Weapons can increase your range, deal physical or magic damage, launch projectiles, and/or even be upgraded! <strong>Don't forget to collect artifacts</strong> along the way to build synergy with your weapons and play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.mp4?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what kinds of challenges await you in the tower?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.mp4?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifiers provide many combinations</strong> of interesting &amp; game-changing challenges to spice up your runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/b6afaa184d5180431023fd7624e71319.avif?t=1754415086\" width=852 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/72968ee22ef0a025347f50dd1a298f2f.avif?t=1754415086\" width=506 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The evil necromancer Bobo</strong> is constructing a Big Tower to Heaven to harness it's power and conquer The Realm! Can the creatures of The Realm stop Bobo before its too late?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins as Bibi</strong>, the hopeful, fluffy, and surprisingly purple adventurer! Each character you unlock has their own reason for conquering <i>Bobo's Big Tower</i>. Try to beat the final boss of each story line to piece together the full history of the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/473b49fa03e664d2b1dfd2106116bf7d.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/473b49fa03e664d2b1dfd2106116bf7d.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/473b49fa03e664d2b1dfd2106116bf7d.mp4?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/2746dd65bc06444cc21f819327697563.avif?t=1754415086\" width=506 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bobo's Big Tower</i> is an adorable roguelike strategy game</strong> in a style inspired by the GameBoy Color (8bit, 16x16, 3 colors per sprite + transparency!). Choose from a colorful cast of characters and solve procedurally-generated floors of puzzles to survive the onslaught of Bobo's minions blocking your path! <strong>Time only moves when you do</strong>, so be sure to strategize critically before each move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every character has their own starter items</strong> and weapon pools to work with throughout each run. Weapons can increase your range, deal physical or magic damage, launch projectiles, and/or even be upgraded! <strong>Don't forget to collect artifacts</strong> along the way to build synergy with your weapons and play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.mp4?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what kinds of challenges await you in the tower?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.poster.avif?t=1754415086\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.webm?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.mp4?t=1754415086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifiers provide many combinations</strong> of interesting &amp; game-changing challenges to spice up your runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/b6afaa184d5180431023fd7624e71319.avif?t=1754415086\" width=852 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://